{"matched":48,"pages":[{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0347a01","n":"0347a","t":"成唯識論述記卷第四本沙門"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0347b01","n":"0347b","t":"非世間現量境故唯信聖言及"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0347c01","n":"0347c","t":"下半可知上半頌文義有異故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0348b01","n":"0348b","t":"性應亦有依下顯第八識亦以"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0348c01","n":"0348c","t":"故執持第一句雜染種子故云"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0349b01","n":"0349b","t":"種非執涅槃涅槃不親依此識"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0349c01","n":"0349c","t":"是染淨二法別依第二句依屬"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0350a01","n":"0350a","t":"起故是彼性或趣是見趣起二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0351a01","n":"0351a","t":"迴心若凡若聖皆不為說應不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0351b01","n":"0351b","t":"不知俱生分別二惑過失妄為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0351c01","n":"0351c","t":"屬隨文可悉然境等風所擊之"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0352a01","n":"0352a","t":"我違數取趣豈即至教量所攝"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0352b01","n":"0352b","t":"許發智非佛語耶為如增一等"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0352c01","n":"0352c","t":"我正法可怖等事又分十八部"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0353a01","n":"0353a","t":"等又小乘經應非佛說與大乘"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0353b01","n":"0353b","t":"乘是佛說今佛亦應說此大乘"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0353c01","n":"0353c","t":"得大菩提故有四因緣非以聲"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0354a01","n":"0354a","t":"是菩薩法空不違此空得大菩"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0354b01","n":"0354b","t":"心者一有分二能引發三見四"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0354c01","n":"0354c","t":"欣欣故於未來喜今但總言是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0355a01","n":"0355a","t":"我故世親不解無性云貪俱樂"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0355b01","n":"0355b","t":"除彼犢子部師彼亦如前非著"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0355c01","n":"0355c","t":"中此但有五可具對明不解三"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0356a01","n":"0356a","t":"熏夫堅性者可持種故識若不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0356b01","n":"0356b","t":"如自他身六種轉識故論文云"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0356c01","n":"0356c","t":"如文可知一類之因簡前善等"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0357a01","n":"0357a","t":"中二宗因云非心性故喻云如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0357c01","n":"0357c","t":"具堅無記義故可熏者今非之"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0358a01","n":"0358a","t":"故然汝不許是此本意若以根"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0358b01","n":"0358b","t":"受熏故言唯六識無前熏後故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0358c01","n":"0358c","t":"恐無心時心斷故色中有心等"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0359b01","n":"0359b","t":"可信此識勸清辨等以生信也"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0360b01","n":"0360b","t":"即善無漏心位等或是餘無心"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0360c01","n":"0360c","t":"攝若不遍者即非趣生故四要"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0361a01","n":"0361a","t":"此唯第六意識中者五識雖亦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0361b01","n":"0361b","t":"相應命根等故若破薩婆多不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0361c01","n":"0361c","t":"法故佛地論中亦同此解述曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0362a01","n":"0362a","t":"六識一類異熟無記性攝不可"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0362b01","n":"0362b","t":"能執有漏身者設六轉識無漏"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0362c01","n":"0362c","t":"等謂薩婆多心能執受前已破"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0363b01","n":"0363b","t":"論主釋言此於我前理非為過"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0364b01","n":"0364b","t":"云是破他故且言無意非唯一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0364c01","n":"0364c","t":"識故六轉識違於正理此中所"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0365a01","n":"0365a","t":"二因彼界無有能引起定散心"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0365b01","n":"0365b","t":"依染污故時無斷故意識所緣"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0365c01","n":"0365c","t":"於心此處初生最後捨故述曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0366a01","n":"0366a","t":"而亦緣而不執受如髮髮等故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0366b01","n":"0366b","t":"解又復彼設爾但以自相望前"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T43n1830-成唯識論述記卷004a","source":"CBETA T43n1830 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":124,"unit":"T43 頁欄"}